WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.812
TFW Program Abuse.

00:00:02.762 --> 00:00:07.800
Our grandparents came through Pier 21 with nothing but the clothes on their backs.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.875
They learned the language, built communities, and earned their place in this country.

00:00:12.875 --> 00:00:27.087
They would be disgusted by a system that imports human beings as disposable labour units — tied to a single employer, housed in squalor, paid poverty wages — while corporations post record profits and call it a labour shortage.

00:00:27.087 --> 00:00:29.612
This is not anti-immigrant.

00:00:29.612 --> 00:00:32.200
This is anti-exploitation.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:38.850
The TFW program victimizes everyone except the employers and the politicians who enable them.

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:43.500
Every number on this page comes from the Government of Canada's own data.
